</div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-luxury text-muted-foreground animate-pulse">Role para descobrir</div></section><section id="sobre" class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-40 w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-[120px]"></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-6 relative"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden shadow-elegant"><img src="./Império MD Beauty Lounge — Transformações Capilares de Alto Padrão_files/about-OK7ArIrA.jpg" alt="Interior do salão" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover"><div class="absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-primary/20"></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-4 lg:-right-8 glass p-6 max-w-[220px] shadow-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-crown w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.734H5.81a1 1 0 0 1-.957-.734L2.02 6.02a.5.5 0 0 1 .798-.519l4.276 3.664a1 1 0 0 0 1.516-.294z"></path><path d="M5 21h14"></path></svg><div class="font-display text-xl">Excelência absoluta</div><div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">Em cada detalhe da sua transformação</div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><div class="h-px w-12 bg-gold-gradient"></div><span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-luxury text-primary">Sobre nós</span></div><h2 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-tight">Um <em class="not-italic text-gold-gradient">império</em> dedicado<br>à sua beleza.</h2><p class="mt-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">A <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Império MD Beauty Lounge</span> nasceu para oferecer muito mais do que um simples atendimento — entregamos uma experiência completa de sofisticação, cuidado e resultados extraordinários.</p><p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Especialistas em transformações capilares de alto padrão, combinamos técnicas modernas, produtos premium e um olhar artístico exclusivo para revelar o melhor de cada cliente.</p><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gem w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.5 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-2.5-6"></path><path d="M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.6.8l3 4a2 2 0 0 1 .013 2.382l-7.99 10.986a2 2 0 0 1-3.247 0l-7.99-10.986A2 2 0 0 1 2.4 7.8l2.998-3.997A2 2 0 0 1 7 3z"></path><path d="M2 9h20"></path></svg></div><span class="text-sm">Produtos Premium</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg></div><span class="text-sm">Profissionais Master</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stro